  "kanji": "貨",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 貨\ntitle: goods; freight; currency\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-4, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 11\nradical: 貝\nradicalNumber: 154\nonyomi: [カ]\nkunyomi: [たから]\ndistractors: [貸, 貧, 責]\n---\n\n# 貨 — goods; freight; currency\n\n**Strokes:** 11 · **Key (radical):** 貝 (no. 154) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n貨 concerns goods, freight, property or currency. In 硬貨 it contributes to the word for coins; 貨物 concerns cargo or freight.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Imagine the upper 化 transforming the [貝](貝.md) below into goods or money. This is a modern-shape story, not a claim that the character was historically built as a picture of transformation.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| カ | on | [硬貨](../words/硬貨.md) こうか - coin; [通貨](../words/通貨.md) つうか - currency |\n| たから | kun | 貨 たから - treasure |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [硬貨](../words/硬貨.md) こうか - coin\n- [銅貨](../words/銅貨.md) どうか - copper coin\n- [貨物](../words/貨物.md) かもつ - cargo; freight\n- [通貨](../words/通貨.md) つうか - currency\n\n## Notes\n\n- JMdict lists 貨 たから in the same treasure family as [宝](宝.md) and [財](財.md), without a rarity flag on 貨. This establishes recognition, not equal frequency or a recommendation to replace 宝 in everyday writing.\n- Do not mix up 貨 with [貸](貸.md), lend. 貨 has 化 above 貝, whereas 貸 has 代 above it.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1195890, 1280530, 1454350, 1516160 and 1433050.\n",
